case:        TC-16 — Every tool declares its version
purpose:     Checks that each installed tool states a version, so the team can always say exactly which tool versions were validated (bundled third-party office tools are exempt).
approach:    Sweeps every installed skill and verifies a version declaration exists in its metadata or VERSION file; lists any tool that has none.
